<view class="page-shell systems-page">
  <include wx:if="{{!result}}" src="../../templates/method-tabs.wxml" />
  <block wx:if="{{!result}}">
    <view class="hero-title">从两个数字开始</view
    ><view class="hero-copy">心里想一件事，写下先想到的数字。</view>
    <view class="panel-card form-card">
      <view class="form-field"
        ><view class="form-label"
          >想问什么 <text class="optional">可选</text></view
        ><textarea
          class="question-input"
          value="{{questionInput}}"
          maxlength="60"
          placeholder="例如：这次合作，我可以先做什么？"
          bindinput="handleQuestionInput"
        />
      </view>
      <view class="form-field form-grid">
        <view
          ><view class="form-label">第一个数字</view
          ><input
            class="form-input"
            type="number"
            maxlength="3"
            placeholder="1—999"
            value="{{first}}"
            data-field="first"
            bindinput="handleNumberInput"
        /></view>
        <view
          ><view class="form-label">第二个数字</view
          ><input
            class="form-input"
            type="number"
            maxlength="3"
            placeholder="1—999"
            value="{{second}}"
            data-field="second"
            bindinput="handleNumberInput"
        /></view>
      </view>
      <button class="primary-button form-submit" bindtap="handleGenerate">
        起一卦
      </button>
      <view class="subtle-note"
        >采用数字起卦：两数定上下卦，加当前北京时间时支定动爻。结果会显示本卦、互卦、变卦及计算规则。</view
      >
    </view>
  </block>
  <include src="../../templates/reading-result.wxml" />
</view>
<include src="../../templates/review-note.wxml" />
<include src="../../templates/poster.wxml" />
